{"product": {"id": 9902586462487, "title": "Ausom F1 Max Electric Scooter", "body_html": "<p><span><strong>Massive 62 Miles Range:</strong> Powered by a high-capacity 20.8 Ah battery, the <strong>F1 Max</strong> is engineered for those who demand a reliable\u00a0<strong>long-range electric scooter</strong> for weekly commuting without frequent charging.</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Up to 3840W Peak Power:</strong> Effortlessly conquer 38% inclines and hit top speeds of up to\u00a0 45mph. Its robust motor provides the torque needed for swift urban acceleration.</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Superior Ride Comfort:</strong> Featuring a <strong>swingarm suspension system</strong> and 10-inch fat tires, the F1 Max absorbs shocks from uneven roads, providing a \"cloud-like\" riding experience.</span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Smart Safety Tech:</strong> Dual disc brakes with E-ABS and a bright 360\u00b0 lighting system work together to enhance control, visibility, and safety - especially during night rides.\u00a0</span></p>", "vendor": "Ausom", "product_type": "Electric Scooter", "created_at": "2025-03-24T15:25:07+08:00", "handle": "ausom-f1-max-electric-scooter", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T20:44:17+08:00", "published_at": "2025-06-16T09:04:38+08:00", "template_suffix": "f1-max-new-ausomstore", "published_scope": "web", "tags": "Ausom F1 Max Electric Scooter, BF, commuting scooter, E-Scooter, electric scooter, powered scooter", "variants": [{"id": 50321065935127, "product_id": 9902586462487, "title": "US Version", "price": "1479.00", "sku": "1297488", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "1549.00", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": "shopify", "option1": "US Version", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2025-03-24T15:25:08+08:00", "updated_at": "2026-11-17T20:44:17+08:00", "taxable": false, "barcode": "6975606877957", "grams": 0, "image_id": 48563870040343, "weight": 0.0, "weight_unit": "kg", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1